      "english": "I studied law at university.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27839_osameru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{学問|がくもん}を{修|おさ}めるだけでなく、{身|み}を{修|おさ}めることも{大切|たいせつ}だ。",
      "english": "It is important not only to master learning but also to cultivate one's character.",
