        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A meaning-specific spelling of おさめる for acquiring learning or cultivating oneself. Distinguish from its homophones below.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {学問|がくもん}を{修|おさ}める: to master one's studies\n- {学業|がくぎょう}を{修|おさ}める: to complete an education\n- {身|み}を{修|おさ}める: to cultivate one's character\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {収|おさ}める: to obtain; to put away — e.g. {成功|せいこう}を{収|おさ}める\n- {治|おさ}める: to govern; to quell — e.g. {国|くに}を{治|おさ}める\n- {納|おさ}める: to pay in; to deliver — e.g. {税金|ぜいきん}を{納|おさ}める",
